{"id":"n14668-5-7","stage":5,"title":"가시 · 刺儿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14668-5-7-1","ko":"난 장미가 꽃 중에서 제일 좋아.","zh":"在所有的花里，我最喜欢玫瑰了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장미가","meaning":"玫瑰，蔷薇","explanation":"장미：玫瑰，蔷薇；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장미","audio":"/audio/5b91cb2b3aa9deb81cb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31498","senseId":"1","lemma":"장미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽃","meaning":"花，花朵","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중에서","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"5b91cb2b3aa9deb8","term":"장미","zh":"玫瑰，蔷薇","audio":"/audio/5b91cb2b3aa9deb81cb0.mp3","entryId":"31498","definition":"茎上有刺，五月或六月开有香气的红色、白色、黄色花朵。","pronunciation":["장미"]},{"id":"1543c99e8fd9f44d","term":"꽃","zh":"花，花朵","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3","entryId":"62838","definition":"长在植物茎干顶端的一部分，具有特有的模样、颜色和香气；或指会开此物的植物。","pronunciation":["꼳"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"92032","definition":"在多个对象中首屈一指地。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/7115ad3a9af1e6a26b47.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14668-5-7-2","ko":"장미는 예쁘지만 가시가 있어서 위험해 보여.","zh":"玫瑰虽然漂亮，但有刺，看起来很危险。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"장미는","meaning":"玫瑰，蔷薇","explanation":"장미：玫瑰，蔷薇；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장미","audio":"/audio/5b91cb2b3aa9deb81cb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31498","senseId":"1","lemma":"장미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁘지만","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가시가","meaning":"刺儿","explanation":"가시：刺儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가시","audio":"/audio/7b77e80a2b3ffa41b641.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14668","senseId":"5","lemma":"가시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어서","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위험해","meaning":"危险","explanation":"위험하다：危险；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"위험하다","audio":"/audio/b5bc2bdd91e111ed65a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69909","senseId":"1","lemma":"위험하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5b91cb2b3aa9deb8","term":"장미","zh":"玫瑰，蔷薇","audio":"/audio/5b91cb2b3aa9deb81cb0.mp3","entryId":"31498","definition":"茎上有刺，五月或六月开有香气的红色、白色、黄色花朵。","pronunciation":["장미"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"7b77e80a2b3ffa41","term":"가시","zh":"刺儿","audio":"/audio/7b77e80a2b3ffa41b641.mp3","entryId":"14668","definition":"长在植物茎、叶或果实表面的又细又尖的针状东西。","pronunciation":["가시"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b5bc2bdd91e111ed","term":"위험하다","zh":"危险","audio":"/audio/b5bc2bdd91e111ed65a2.mp3","entryId":"69909","definition":"有可能受到损害或伤害而不安全。","pronunciation":["위험하다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6381fedc77d5bce1ec42.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.356,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14668","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"고급","day":161,"sequenceScore":3.1827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["玫瑰虽然漂亮，但有刺，看起来很危险。","你一个人能做完所有的工作吗？","在所有的花里，我最喜欢玫瑰了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["玫瑰虽然漂亮，但有刺，看起来很危险。","在所有的花里，我最喜欢玫瑰了。","你一个人能做完所有的工作吗？"],"answer":0}]}
